The Ministry of Cultural Progress (MoCuP) owns the right to broadcast on the radio spectrum in [[Geography/Calaria/index|Calaria]], [[Geography/Tormeré/index|Tormeré]] and part of [[Geography/Brithwyn/index|Brithwyn]]. It began as a convox of the [[Org/Iridescent Church/index|Iridescent Church]] before it was spun off into a body of its own, and it stays closely tied to the Church and to the Calarian government.

The Ministry decides who may broadcast and when, funds radio shows, curates music stations, and produces radio dramas and screamsheet editorials. Listening to its stations is a popular pastime across the country.
